'''Occultist Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. She was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 853
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Occultist Cat
|name2 = Gyaru Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gyaru Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A middling cat all around; she has good range and decent damage against targets when fully leveled, but her Single Attack holds her back tremendously. Great for [[Heartbeat Catcademy|her event]], but best left forgotten by the time the player obtains [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

