==Trivia==
*Occultist Cat is based on [[Wikipedia:Chūnibyō|Chūnibyō]], a Japanese colloquial term typically used to describe adolescents with delusions of grandeur. These teenagers convince themselves that they have hidden knowledge or secret powers, usually in a desperate attempt to stand out. It is often referred to as "eight-grader syndrome".
*Gyaru Cat is based on the ''[[wikipedia:Gyaru|gyaru]]'' fashion subculture. Makeup, short skirts, loose socks and dyed hair (usually blonde or light brown) are all common elements of ''gyaru''.

